/economy/startup_story/2025/05/04/V5YCBOMYTFBWLMZMGTGDVV26X4/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"경제","categories":["economy"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/economy/?outputType=xml"},"title":"美 하원 미중전략경쟁특별위원장 “알리바바 등 미 주식시장 상장 중국 기업 퇴출해야”","partialText":"","date":"2025-05-03T04:57:30.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/economy/int_economy/2025/05/03/AGK4UZVCPZCMLMTWAVPOS6HPGY/"}]